# The published snapshot IS committed -- GitHub Pages has to serve it, and
# release assets cannot be fetched cross-origin. See HANDOFF.md.
!docs/data/domains.json

# 468 small shards, ~3.7 MB, derived from CMUdict. CI rebuilds them into the
# Pages artifact on every deploy, so they are served without ever entering git.
# For a local preview: python3 -m pdgen dictionary build
docs/data/cmudict/
